ddressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>An image retrieval device comprises a retrieval data generator section that extracts feature patterns from a voice signal synchronized with an image signal containing images to be retrieved to generate an index for image retrieval, and a retrieval section for collating a keyword entered by a user with the index to a retrieve desired image.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>L'invention porte sur un dispositif de recherche d'images comportant un générateur de données de recherche qui extrait des motifs caractéristiques d'un signal vocal synchronisé avec un signal contenant des images à rechercher pour créer une liste de recherche d'image, et une section de recherche faisant coïncider un mot clef entré par l'utilisateur avec la liste pour retrouver l'image désirée.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>